00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:37.900
Dolly: …Then it's home.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:47.500
Dolly: …Is that tattoo permanent?

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:47.500
Willy: Until the next update!

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:58.600
